</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Pardon our offences,</l><l>Loose our captive chains,</l><l>Break down every idol</l><l>Which our soul detains.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Give us holy freedom,</l><l>Fill our heart with grace;</l><l>Lead us on our journey,</l><l>Till we win the race.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus, meek and gentle,</l><l>Son of God most high,</l><l>Pitying, loving Savior,</l><l>Hear Thy children’s cry.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
